      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "If one does not already exist, create a new instance of UCombinedTransformGizmoContextObject and add it to the\nToolsContext's ContextObjectStore\n@return true if the ContextObjectStore now has a UCombinedTransformGizmoContextObject (whether it already existed, or was created)"
